# The never-store paths of the Substrate atlas's charter/never-store.yaml, so nothing on that list can be
# staged here, and a recording house's local detail, which never leaves its house (JETSAM, rule 2).
**/SubstrateSoulData/**
**/RECALL*.md
**/recall_spec*
**/*.enc
**/.prev/**
**/SubstrateSoul.prev/**
**/transcripts/**
**/*.transcript.*
**/.env
**/*.pem
**/*.key
**/jetsam/local/
__pycache__/
.pytest_cache/
